A differential suite that cannot fail proves nothing, so [38;5;10mvalidate_harness.sh[0m injects 7 known bugs into the Rust and confirms each is caught — including the two subtle C quirks worth calling out, both of which the translation already reproduces faithfully:[0m[0m
